      "updated": 1780119343055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "reading in the form of byte[] is the problem Type conversion became\nproblem in java so java introduced a special class called",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "reading in the form of byte[] is the problem Type conversion became\nproblem in java so java introduced a special class called",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vUBfj8QxL4-i5BES6bL78",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1551.7039070637584,
      "y": 903.4855067232565,
      "width": 1702.1876220703125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 88644080,
      "version": 709,
      "versionNonce": 2067713520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780119343055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The main Problem in BufferedStreamReader is that there is not direct Type convertion\nwe have to do manualy may rise Runtime Exceptions that is where Scanner class was introduced ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The main Problem in BufferedStreamReader is that there is not direct Type convertion\nwe have to do manualy may rise Runtime Exceptions that is where Scanner class was introduced ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
